# spokes: draws a spokes pattern in its 256 by 256 window (Icon's random sequence, the same every run) and waits; n draws the next pattern
# (after the program's own one-second pause), s opens the library's snapshot dialog (it stands under the pointer), a typed name and Return
# (Okay) write the image file spokes1.gif (part of the answer), and q ends the program by itself
move 128 128
key n
wait
key s
wait
type spokes1.gif
key Return
wait
key q
